    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "VS Code, measured 11-12 Oct 2026",
      "items": [
        "The extension loads in VS Code's Copilot chat only with the setting \"chat.canvases.enabled\": true, from the same ~/.copilot/extensions install.",
        "Typed in full, /cache-clock works but is not listed in the / menu. Its card, help and settings appear as a question with an OK button, because plain session messages show there only as error boxes.",
        "The heads-up and the sending-cold note reach only VS Code's log. Sessions keep usage checkpoints only, so the report counts them as totals."
      ]
